  "body": "## Finding description and impact\nThe investment Vault has self approval check. Where the users can't approve themselves. Only the `validator` address can approval them using `WRC7575ShareToken::permit()` method. Once approved, the `withdraw()` or `redeem()` can be called. But there is no validation on the `msg.sender` or the `receiver`. \n\nSo anyone can drain any vault as long as there is some address that have self approval. So, as soon as the `validator` gives the self approval, anyone can execute the `withdraw()` or `redeem()` and take the assets out to their own address.\n\n```solidity\n    function redeem(uint256 shares, address receiver, address owner) public nonReentrant whenNotPaused returns (uint256 assets) {\n        assets = previewRedeem(shares);\n        _withdraw(assets, shares, receiver, owner);\n    }\n\n    function withdraw(uint256 assets, address receiver, address owner) public nonReentrant whenNotPaused returns (uint256 shares) {\n        shares = previewWithdraw(assets);\n        _withdraw(assets, shares, receiver, owner);\n    }\n\n    function _withdraw(uint256 assets, uint256 shares, address receiver, address owner) internal {\n        if (receiver == address(0)) {\n            revert IERC20Errors.ERC20InvalidReceiver(address(0));\n        }\n        if (owner == address(0)) {\n            revert IERC20Errors.ERC20InvalidSender(address(0));\n        }\n        if (assets == 0) revert ZeroAssets();\n        if (shares == 0) revert ZeroShares();\n\n        _shareToken.spendSelfAllowance(owner, shares);\n        _shareToken.burn(owner, shares);\n        SafeTokenTransfers.safeTransfer(_asset, receiver, assets);\n        emit Withdraw(msg.sender, receiver, owner, assets, shares);\n    }\n\n```\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\nAdd the allowance check in `_withdraw()` method.\n1) WERC7575Vault.sol:\n```diff\n    function _withdraw(uint256 assets, uint256 shares, address receiver, address owner) internal {\n        if (receiver == address(0)) {\n            revert IERC20Errors.ERC20InvalidReceiver(address(0));\n        }\n        if (owner == address(0)) {\n            revert IERC20Errors.ERC20InvalidSender(address(0));\n        }\n        if (assets == 0) revert ZeroAssets();\n        if (shares == 0) revert ZeroShares();\n\n        _shareToken.spendSelfAllowance(owner, shares);\n++      if(msg.sender != owner) {\n++          _shareToken.spendAllowance(owner, msg.sender, shares);\n++      }\n        _shareToken.burn(owner, shares);\n        SafeTokenTransfers.safeTransfer(_asset, receiver, assets);\n        emit Withdraw(msg.sender, receiver, owner, assets, shares);\n    }\n```\n2) WRC7575ShareToken.sol\n```diff\n++  function spendAllowance(address owner, address spender, uint256 shares) external onlyVaults {\n++      _spendAllowance(owner, spender, shares);\n++  }\n```",
